---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import data from '../../data/content.json';
export function getStaticPaths(){return data.themes.map(theme=>({params:{id:theme.id},props:{theme}}));}
const {theme}=Astro.props;
---
<Shell title={theme.title}><a class="back-link" href="/themes/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> All threads</a><section class="intro" data-theme-page={theme.id}><span class="eyebrow">{theme.category} · Thread {String(theme.number).padStart(2,'0')} of {data.themes.length}</span> <h1>{theme.title}</h1> <p>Read the three passages first. What do they have in common?</p></section><div class="workspace"><section>{theme.passages.map((p,i)=><><article class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Reading {i+1} · Quran {p.ref}</h2> <a class="citation" href={p.translationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read in context ↗</a></div> <div class="panel-body"><p class="arabic" lang="ar" dir="rtl">{p.arabic}</p><blockquote class="source-quote">{p.translation}</blockquote><p class="micro">Marmaduke Pickthall · Quran {p.ref}</p></div></article>{' '}</>)}<div id="solve-cta" class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/?puzzle=${theme.id}`}>Solve this thread <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p id="solved-note" class="micro" role="status" hidden>You have solved or revealed this thread. Its theme is open beside the passages.</p></section> <aside class="sidebar"><details class="spoiler panel panel-body" id="thread"><summary>Show the thread (spoiler)</summary><p><strong>{theme.theme}.</strong> {theme.explanation}</p><p class="micro">An editorial comparison of these passages, not a scholarly ruling.</p><a class="citation" href={theme.commentaryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Al-Tafsir al-Muyassar for {theme.anchor} ↗</a></details> <div class="panel panel-body"><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-save={theme.id} aria-pressed="false">Save</button><p class="micro top-gap">Saved threads stay in this browser.</p></div></aside></div></Shell>
<script>import '../../lib/themes';</script>
<style>.spoiler summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent-ink);font-weight:600}.spoiler p{margin-top:10px}</style>
